# Each entry needs a reason. Re-verify the "false positive" ones against a
# real `terraform plan` JSON (trivy config on the plan) once the account exists.

# ECR mutable tags: ci.yml still pushes :latest. Flip to IMMUTABLE with the
# Week 3 pipeline (commit-SHA / digest tags).
AVD-AWS-0031

# Plain HTTP listener: only reached when var.certificate_arn is empty
# (throwaway dev stack). With a certificate the listener redirects to HTTPS.
AVD-AWS-0054

# S3 public access block: false positive. aws_s3_bucket_public_access_block.this
# is for_each'd over all three buckets with all four flags true; the scanner
# cannot resolve for_each to the bucket resources.
AVD-AWS-0086
AVD-AWS-0087
AVD-AWS-0091
AVD-AWS-0093

# CMK encryption: kyc and cloudtrail use CMKs via for_each (same scanner
# limitation). The logs bucket is SSE-S3 on purpose: S3 server access logs
# and ALB access logs cannot be delivered to a KMS-encrypted bucket.
AVD-AWS-0132
